  "notes": [
    "First engineered use: 0x163ee09d left 1 LP in pool 0xabe82d12 and 0x8fba3061 deposited into the jumped update. Earlier stale-writeoff windfalls (53.6 COVER on 2020-11-26, 368.9 on 12-22) came from LPs rolling into freshly listed pools and are not counted.",
    "The anchor's pool was listed by the owner multisig's addPools; a market listing is a HIGH config (rule 10). Campaign: the six exploiters' deposits with >0.5 COVER stale credit and their minting withdrawals, from a scan of all 5,377 Blacksmith deposits.",
    "Minted COVER crashed under the dumps, so it is valued at the six exploiters' realised 4,308.5 ETH, 83.48 (a)WBTC and 1.40M DAI at Uniswap USDC-pair prices. Grap Finance's 4.08e19 COVER mint is excluded: a rescue whose proceeds went back to Cover."
